---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Justices" current="/justices">
  <div class="hero-band"><h1>The Justices</h1><p>The League, sitting en banc.</p></div>
  <div class="wrap plain-list">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The Supreme Court of Fantasy Football consists of the League sitting en banc. Every member of the League is a Justice, except the Commissioner, who is a party, and the Clerk, who as of September 2 is Aaron, having announced "I am the clerk" and met no objection. His predecessor was a trash bin.</p>
      <p>There is no Chief Justice. Seniority is determined by draft position, which is itself the subject of pending litigation.</p>
      <p>The Court's composition will be published upon confirmation of the roster. Justices are not required to have read the briefs, attended argument, or set their lineups.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
